{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1349501-randomly-generate-awakened-characters","id":1349501,"title":"Randomly generate Awakened characters","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-18T22:42:58-08:00","id":1349501,"title":"Randomly generate Awakened characters","content":"I don't know who needed this, but I wrote a guide full of dozens of tables that you can use to roll a random Mage (2nd edition rules). <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tz9mY3nBnwPATAR-lDkIX6x8Ep5sZpgfNndM796rJFg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tz9mY3nBnwPATAR-lDkIX6x8Ep5sZpgfNndM796rJFg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tz9mY3nBnwPATAR-lDkIX6x8Ep5sZpgfNndM796rJFg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tz9mY3nBnwPATAR-lDkIX6x8Ep5sZpgfNndM796rJFg/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> A good use for this document is creating diverse characters quickly for a one-shot adventure. Sometimes I have a an idea of a Mystery that I want to use for a quick game, but making new characters every time can be a chore. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T03:08:58-08:00","id":1349536,"title":"","content":"Excellent. I love that you weighted the Orders differently.<br /> <br /> Only criticism I have is that the explanation for Attributes is a little unclear. Took me a few reads to work it out, though that may just be me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T07:43:32-08:00","id":1349584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1349501-randomly-generate-awakened-characters?p=1349536#post1349536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Excellent. I love that you weighted the Orders differently.<br /> <br /> Only criticism I have is that the explanation for Attributes is a little unclear. Took me a few reads to work it out, though that may just be me.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for the feedback, I made a little tweak to it and added an example. <br /> <br /> I am also open to ideas if people want to randomize additional stuff for a mage character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T09:28:21-08:00","id":1349598,"title":"","content":"One other thing, I'm not sure what the '&gt;' mean in the merit section. Is that just what you get for rolling the same number a few times?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T09:55:19-08:00","id":1349604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1349501-randomly-generate-awakened-characters?p=1349598#post1349598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One other thing, I'm not sure what the '&gt;' mean in the merit section. Is that just what you get for rolling the same number a few times?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Correct, if you roll into it again you get whats after the &gt;<br /> <br /> I had the explanation elsewhere, but should put it closer to that table, thanks for the feedback again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T11:42:49-08:00","id":1349636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>arthexis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1349501-randomly-generate-awakened-characters?p=1349604#post1349604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Correct, if you roll into it again you get whats after the &gt;<br /> <br /> I had the explanation elsewhere, but should put it closer to that table, thanks for the feedback again.</div> </div> </div> </div>The issue was more that the explanation immediately below says you combine the dots of rolled merits with merits you already have. Which I just realised probably means merits you got before that stage, not the ones you're rolling for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-21T15:20:07-08:00","id":1350137,"title":"","content":"I got partway through implementing this as a javascript tool for making random Mages before I got bored. Might finish it up later tonight and post it for people to use if you're cool with that (with credit to you, of course)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T19:02:31-08:00","id":1350366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BlueWinds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1349501-randomly-generate-awakened-characters?p=1350137#post1350137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I got partway through implementing this as a javascript tool for making random Mages before I got bored. Might finish it up later tonight and post it for people to use if you're cool with that (with credit to you, of course)?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sure, that would be great! Please include a link to the doc? Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-23T11:06:06-08:00","id":1350468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://threewestwinds.com/randomMage.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://threewestwinds.com/randomMage.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Error 404 (Not Found)!!1 </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://threewestwinds.com/randomMage.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://threewestwinds.com/randomMage.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Here we go! I didn't implement absolutely everything, and tweaked a few of the tables to make things a tad bit simpler. Also threw in a random name generator based on markov chains that I wrote for another game.<br /> <br /> Apologies to anyone looking at the source. This is the laziest code I've written in a long time. ^^;;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-24T12:52:46-08:00","id":1350692,"title":"","content":"Ooh I love it. Meet <a href=\"http://threewestwinds.com/randomMage.html#0.0771544019555398\" target=\"_blank\">Katrin Fultewer</a>, Silver Ladder Acanthus trained in world-class heists. And she has an Infamous Mentor too! Clearly they need help from the PCs on their next job...<br /> <br /> Hmm, I wonder how Dream and 5 dots in Astral Adept fits? Technically impossible (3 dots max AA I believe), and a bad match for Wits 1 Composure 1 Mind 0, but there must be a good story/custom Merit in there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":181,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/181-codesmithkarl","user":"codesmithKarl","date":". 11-24-2019, 04:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/181-codesmithkarl","name":"codesmithKarl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}